Maintainer: Gabriel Rodriguez-Rondon <gabrodriguezrondon@gmail.com>
Description: Estimation, testing and inference for multiple structural changes at unknown
    dates in a system of equations, following Qu and Perron (2007) <doi:10.1111/j.1468-0262.2006.00754.x>.
    Changes may occur in the regression coefficients, in the covariance matrix of the errors, or
    in both, with linear restrictions within and across regimes. Provides quasi-maximum-likelihood
    estimates of the break dates and coefficients, sup-LR, WDmax and sequential tests for the
    number of breaks, and simulated critical values for any number of changing parameters.
